---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service – Fullfill">
  <section class="terms-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p><strong>Updated 15 Nov 2026</strong></p>
      <p>By using Fullfill (app, website, or services), you agree to these terms.</p>
      <p><strong>Who we are.</strong> Fullfill is operated by PALITECH, Grafenberger Allee 114, 40237 D&uuml;sseldorf, Germany. Contact: <a href="mailto:hello@fullfill.me">hello@fullfill.me</a></p>

      <h2>1. What Fullfill Is</h2>
      <p>
        Fullfill is a wellness and self-growth platform offering journaling, breathing, routines, audio, video, and educational tools.  
        It is not medical or mental-health advice and does not replace professional care.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Eligibility</h2>
      <p>
        You must be 18+ and use the app legally. You are responsible for your account and keeping login details secure.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Subscriptions, Free Trials &amp; Billing</h2>
      <p><strong>3.1 Free and paid features.</strong> Some features of Fullfill are free. Others need a paid subscription ("Fullfill Premium"). The app shows which is which.</p>
      <p><strong>3.2 Plans.</strong> We offer monthly and annual subscriptions. The current price, billing period and any introductory offer are shown in the app before you buy. Prices may vary by country and include applicable taxes where required.</p>
      <p><strong>3.3 Free trial.</strong> New subscribers may get a free trial (currently 14 days). You are not charged during the trial. Unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the trial ends, your subscription starts automatically and you are charged the price shown at purchase. We aim to remind you before the trial ends by email and/or push notification, if you have enabled them.</p>
      <p><strong>3.4 Automatic renewal.</strong> Subscriptions renew automatically at the end of each billing period, at the then-current price, unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the period ends. Your store account is charged within 24 hours before renewal.</p>
      <p><strong>3.5 Introductory prices.</strong> Introductory or launch prices apply for the period stated in the app. After that, the regular price applies unless we tell you otherwise.</p>
      <p><strong>3.6 Payment.</strong> Payments are processed by Apple (App Store) or Google (Google Play), depending on where you subscribed. Their terms also apply. We never see or store your card details.</p>
      <p><strong>3.7 How to cancel.</strong> You can cancel at any time:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>iPhone/iPad: Settings &rarr; [your name] &rarr; Subscriptions &rarr; Fullfill &rarr; Cancel Subscription</li>
        <li>Android: Google Play &rarr; Profile &rarr; Payments &amp; subscriptions &rarr; Subscriptions &rarr; Fullfill &rarr; Cancel</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Deleting the app or your account does not cancel a subscription. If you cancel, you keep premium access until the end of the period you have paid for.</p>
      <p><strong>3.8 Refunds.</strong> Refunds are handled by Apple or Google under their refund policies. We cannot issue refunds for store purchases directly. If you have a problem, email <a href="mailto:hello@fullfill.me">hello@fullfill.me</a> and we will help where we can.</p>
      <p><strong>3.9 Restoring purchases.</strong> If you reinstall the app or change devices, use "Restore previous purchase" in the app with the same store account.</p>
      <p><strong>3.10 Corporate / partner access.</strong> Access provided by an employer or partner through an access code is subject to that agreement. It may end when the agreement ends. Codes are personal and may not be shared or sold.</p>
      <p><strong>3.11 Price changes.</strong> We may change subscription prices. We will give you advance notice, and the change applies from your next billing period. Where the law or the app store requires your consent, we will ask for it.</p>
      <p><strong>3.12 Right of withdrawal (EU/UK consumers).</strong> If you are a consumer in the EU or UK, you may have a statutory right to withdraw from a purchase within 14 days. When you start using premium content immediately, you agree that performance begins straight away, and you may lose the right of withdrawal once the digital content has been fully provided, as the law allows. Withdrawal and refund requests for store purchases are handled through Apple or Google.</p>

      <h2>4. AI & Data Processing</h2>
      <p>
        We use secure third-party AI services for features such as transcription, goal optimization, recipe generation, and other smart functions. Relevant data is securely transmitted only as needed.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Location & Notifications</h2>
      <p>
        If enabled, location data (such as timezone) is used only to deliver notifications and nudges at appropriate times. You can turn off push or email notifications at any time in your device settings.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Your Content</h2>
      <p>
        You own what you create (journal entries, uploads). You grant us permission to store and process it within Fullfill to operate the service. Do not upload illegal or harmful content.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Our Content</h2>
      <p>
        All app content, branding, and technology belong to us or our partners. Personal use only. No copying, redistribution, reverse-engineering, or misuse.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>
        Do not misuse the app, attempt unauthorized access, scrape data, impersonate others, or use features unlawfully.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Account Termination</h2>
      <p>
        You may delete your account anytime. We may suspend accounts that violate these terms or legal requirements.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Liability</h2>
      <p>
        Fullfill is provided "as is." We are not responsible for health outcomes, personal decisions, device issues, or third-party service disruptions.
      </p>

      <h2>11. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Germany. If you are a consumer living in the EU or UK, you also keep the protection of the mandatory consumer laws of your country of residence. We are not obliged and not willing to take part in dispute resolution proceedings before a consumer arbitration board.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@fullfill.me">hello@fullfill.me</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .terms-section {
    font-family: var(--font-urbanist);
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px 20px;
  }

  .container {
    width: 100%;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }

  p:first-of-type {
    color: var(--text-secondary, #666);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  ul {
    margin: 0 0 15px 20px;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .terms-section {
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
</style>

<style>
  .terms-section { color: var(--color-text-body); }
  .terms-section h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-urbanist);
    font-size: var(--type-hero) !important;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--color-dark-purple);
  }
  .terms-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-urbanist);
    font-size: var(--type-card) !important;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-brand);
  }
  .terms-section p,
  .terms-section li { font-size: var(--type-body) !important; line-height: 1.5; }
  .terms-section a { color: var(--color-brand); }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .terms-section h1 { font-size: var(--type-section) !important; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 575px) {
    .terms-section h1 { font-size: var(--type-section) !important; }
  }
</style>
